%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/io_test.clj:240 (writeXml-cdata-test)
testing: CData values are wrapped in CDATA sections
元の形: io/writeXml の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
write({"users": {"user": {"mulet/cdata": "Mariano"}, "age": {"mulet/cdata": "31"}}}, "application/xml", {"writeDeclaration": true})
%%% output application/json
"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>\n<users>\n  <user>\n    <mulet/cdata>Mariano</mulet/cdata>\n  </user>\n  <age>\n    <mulet/cdata>31</mulet/cdata>\n  </age>\n</users>"
